# gen_fu_l40_pair_sample_quiesce.log -- landing 40 (TB Infra, 2026-09-04)
#
# WHAT THIS IS. The end-of-run read race of landing 38 has two more instances of the identical shape, and one of
# them fails on the committed code at a measurable seed rate. This log carries the red, the green, the mutation
# proof and the controls for the three tests that compare the retired and consumed counters at the end of a run:
#   dv/auto_dv/gen_tb/gen_tests/gen_ut_intg_store.py   (landing 38's single-instant break, replaced here)
#   dv/auto_dv/gen_tb/gen_tests/gen_ut_lockstep.py     (4-cycle settle then read, replaced here)
#   dv/auto_dv/gen_tb/gen_tests/gen_ut_intg_span.py    (4-cycle settle kept for the export flush, loop added)
# BUILD IDENTITY: every figure below comes from a local out-of-tree root built by dv/auto_dv/tb/gen_tb_local.sh,
# whose "sources sha256" is that runner's find-digest over dv/auto_dv env, tb, isa and gen_tb. It is NOT the
# committer's gate digest and no committed gate identity is claimed for these roots.
# PATHS: $S below is this session's scratchpad, $S/l33 holding the roots (l40_root, l40_mut_root), the scripts
# (l40_setup.sh, l40_sweep.sh, patch_l40.py, l40_mutroot.sh) and the run logs. Scratch is NOT durable, which is
# why each figure block below embeds the lines rather than pointing at them.
#
# ================ THE MECHANISM, quoted from the two writers ================
# $ sed -n '61p' dv/auto_dv/tb/gen_bridge_if.sv
#         if (rvfi_valid) evt_retired_count <= evt_retired_count + 32'd1;
# $ sed -n '513p' dv/auto_dv/env/gen_rvfi_pkg.sv
#         bvif.evt_isa_records = compared + folded;   // records consumed: compared once each, Zcmp micro-ops through their fold
# $ command grep -n 'bvif.evt_isa_records =' dv/auto_dv/env/gen_rvfi_pkg.sv
#   389:        bvif.evt_isa_records = compared + folded;
#   414:        bvif.evt_isa_records = compared + folded;
#   513:      bvif.evt_isa_records = compared + folded;   // records consumed: compared once each, Zcmp micro-ops through their fold
# One retirement, two observers: the interface's counter moves on the clock edge with a non-blocking assignment,
# the comparator's counter is written with a blocking assignment while it processes the record. A sample taken
# between the two reads a pair that differs by one. Equality at a SINGLE INSTANT is therefore not evidence that
# nothing is in flight, which is what CM214-Low-4 said about landing 38's break.
#
